PaymentRails_NativeRoutesAvalancheFork
├── when AVAX is sent with call
│   └── it should accept the value and emit NativeReceived
├── when AVAX is sent with transfer
│   └── it should accept the value within the 2300 gas stipend
├── given native routed to WRAP
│   ├── it should preview the native balance as WAVAX
│   ├── it should mint real WAVAX to the rails one to one
│   ├── it should leave the module clean
│   └── when WAVAX is routed to SWAP
│       └── it should swap the wrapped balance to USDC through the real SwapRouter02
├── given native routed to NATIVE_FORWARD
│   ├── when the recipient is an EOA
│   │   └── it should pay raw AVAX to the recipient
│   └── when the recipient is a contract
│       └── it should deliver the value
├── given WAVAX routed to UNWRAP
│   ├── it should turn real WAVAX back into AVAX on the rails
│   └── it should log the return as a deposit, not a payer receipt
├── given AVAX was force-fed to a fresh rails
│   └── it should be recoverable through a NATIVE_FORWARD route
└── when created by the unchanged factory
    └── it should accept and route AVAX
